Technique 3:For incremental load(files)
---------------------------------------

FLOW:
[Lookup: read watermark.json from ADLS Gen2 → gives last_run_time]
        ↓
[Get Metadata: childItems, with "Last Modified" in the field list]
        ↓
[Filter: item().lastModified > lookup output]
        ↓
[ForEach: loop over filtered files]
        ↓
    [Copy activity: process that file]
        ↓
[Copy/overwrite: write the new watermark value back to watermark.json]

Lookup on a JSON file (not a database in adlsgen2) → Get Metadata for file timestamps → Filter comparing timestamps → ForEach with Copy per file → write the new watermark back at the end

